    "q-139806": {
      "dom_id": "step-q139806",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "A sample ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{6}$ is drawn from a population with population mean $\\mu $ and population variance ${\\sigma }^{2}.$ If $\\mu $ and $\\sigma $ are both unknown, which of the following are statistics?\n\nI. ${\\sum }_{i=1}^{6}({X}_{i}-\\mu )^{2}$\n\nII. $\\text{mode}({X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{6})$\n\nIII. $\\frac{1}{3}({X}_{2}+{X}_{4}+{X}_{6})$",
      "worked_solution": "Suppose ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{n}$ is a sequence of random variables representing a random sample of size $n$ drawn from a population. A statistic is a random variable expressed as a function of ${X}_{i}.$\n\nStatistics cannot involve unknown population parameters.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each expression. \n\n- Expression I is *not* a statistic. It is a function that contains the unknown population mean $\\mu .$\n\n- Expression II is a statistic. It is a function of the sample ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{6}$ only.\n\n- Expression III is also a statistic. It is a function of the sample ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},…,{X}_{6}$ only. Note that a statistic doesn't need to include every sample element.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-139806-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only",
              "html": "III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-139806-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I, II, and III",
              "html": "I, II, and III"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-139806-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only",
              "html": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-139806-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
